\item Ciucci (2018), Old Zamuco dictionary (a close relative of Ayoreo): \url{https://researchonline.jcu.edu.au/55385/1/Ciucci%202018%20Old%20Zamuco%20dictionary.pdf}
\item SAPhon phonological inventory for Ayoreo: \url{https://linguistics.berkeley.edu/saphon/en/inv/Ayoreo.html}
